text literals ".~..~.git~target~\n~: ~\"~~/~.json~SHA256SUMS~records~artifacts~--root~--help~schema~aien-bench-record/1~status~VERIFIED~EXPERIMENTAL~HISTORICAL~NOT_RUN~FAIL~SUPERSEDED~not_recorded~limitations~source~source.commit~source.dirty~build.profile~methodology.token_accounting~methodology.samples~workload~name~methodology.definitions~metrics~evidence~events_not_tokens~backend_usage~release~debug~missing~must be a string~must be an object~must be a finite number~must be a non-negative integer~must be true or false~must be an array of strings~must be an array of paths~is empty~NOT_RUN records carry no measurements~NOT_RUN records carry no evidence~NOT_RUN records have 0 samples~must be at least 1~is empty (only NOT_RUN records may have no evidence)~VERIFIED requires dirty == false~not_recorded is not allowed in this field~not_recorded is only allowed in HISTORICAL or SUPERSEDED records~not_recorded must be explained by a limitations entry naming this field~token metric with token_accounting events_not_tokens (stream events are not tokens)~ is not one of VERIFIED, EXPERIMENTAL, HISTORICAL, NOT_RUN, FAIL, SUPERSEDED~ is not one of release, debug~ is not one of backend_usage, events_not_tokens~ is not a 40-character lowercase hex commit id~placeholder value ~ must be a relative path inside the repository~path does not exist: ~missing definition for metric ~ needs at least ~ samples, record has ~ needs a recorded sample count (methodology.samples is not_recorded)~p~(file)~top level is not a JSON object~invalid JSON~cannot read file~cannot traverse path~ is not aien-bench-record/1~missing (not an aien-bench-record/1 record and not inside a SHA256SUMS bundle)~line ~malformed (expected <64 hex>  <relative name>)~sha256~does not match SHA256SUMS~listed file is missing~file is not listed~[~]~.~bench_verify_records: ~ records, ~ bundles (~ files digest-checked), ~ defects\n~: skipped: not present under the root\n~tbd,todo,unknown,n/a,,example,xxx~tok~tokens~itl~_git_sha~source.repo,source.commit,build.rustc,workload.name,hardware.host,hardware.cpu,hardware.gpu,backend.engine,backend.model,backend.precision,backend.endpoint,methodology.clock~source.dirty,build.profile,build.rustc,hardware.host,hardware.cpu,hardware.gpu,backend.engine,backend.model,backend.precision,backend.endpoint,methodology.clock,methodology.token_accounting,methodology.samples~Usage: bench_verify_records [--root REPO] [PATH...]\nValidate records and SHA256SUMS bundles offline.\n~/usr/bin/git~-C~log~--diff-filter=A~--format=%cs~--~ [git: first commit]~not committed~no git history~docs/PERF_INDEX.md~--check~.md~.om~docs~prime-drag-race~data~prime-drag-race/results~om~# Performance discovery index (generated, not an authority)\n\nGenerated by `build/om/bench_index` from the files in this repository; do not edit by hand. Every status, commit and date is copied from the file named in its row (the field it came from is in brackets), so this page is only as true as those files. Architecture and plans live in aien-spark/aien-architecture. Records are validated by `build/om/bench_verify_records` (see README, \"Evidence integrity\").\n\n~## Records and artifacts\n\nScanned: `records/`, `artifacts/`, `data/`, `prime-drag-race/results/`.\n\n| Path | Kind | Schema | Status | Workload | Commit | Date |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n~\n## Active source paths\n\nScanned: first-party source under `om/`, `src/` and `prime-drag-race/src/`. Text is the first `note `, `//!` or `///` line. Outstanding non-Omega sources remain replacement tasks.\n\n| Path | First doc line |\n| :--- | :--- |\n~\n## Performance studies\n\nScanned: `docs/*.md` (except this file), `prime-drag-race/*.md`. The text is the first `# ` line.\n\n| Path | Title |\n| :--- | :--- |\n~\n## Owning issues\n\nIssue references (`aien-spark/<repo>#N`, `aien-dev/<repo>#N`, GitHub issue or pull links, and `## Owning issue` sections) found in the studies and records above.\n\n| Issue | Mentioned in |\n| :--- | :--- |\n~record~artifact~dataset~summary~ bundle (~ files in SHA256SUMS)~ (not valid JSON)~-~ (not a full commit id)~| `~` | ~ | ~ |\n~, ~`~ [~ ~(no doc comment)~(no title line)~note ~# ~| (none) | | | | | | |\n~| (none) | |\n~manifest.json~timestamp_utc,timestamp,created_utc,date~source.commit,benchmarks_git_sha,benchmark_commit,commit~workload.name,run_id~schema,schema_version~aien-dev/~aien-spark/~/issues/~/pull/~owning issue~ (repository not named)~#~Usage: bench_index [--root REPO] [--check]\nGenerate or check docs/PERF_INDEX.md using native Omega.\n~docs/PERF_INDEX.md is out of date\n~Updated docs/PERF_INDEX.md\n~src~prime-drag-race/src~.rs~//!~///~(item doc) ~"
fn sinit to void
put sp 0 1
start = get sp 0
id = ulong 0
for i ulong len literals
c = get literals i
if eq c 126
put scache id sdone start
id = add id 1
start = get sp 0
else
sbyte c
end
end
end
